Waypoint-1.5 world models by Overworld:
https://huggingface.co/Overworld/Waypoint-1.5-1B
https://huggingface.co/Overworld/Waypoint-1.5-1B-360P
The model weights are licensed under Apache-2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
The WanGP checkpoints keep the released BF16 values; the condition heads, tied across the 24 blocks in training and stored
once per block in the release, are stored once.

The WanGP implementation in this folder was written from the Waypoint-1.5 technical report, the released configurations
and the checkpoint layout; it contains no code of Overworld's inference library (world_engine) or of the model repositories'
code files, which are under GPL-3.0.

